na and post-cast regeneration-delay state; does not absorb Fireball/Frost Field/Force Wave spell-local cooldown, charge, cast, placement, or active-field state.\",\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-003\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"completion_gates\": [\n    {\n      \"reference\": \"GDD §2 Resources, Feedback, and Failure\",\n      \"requirement\": \"Existing Play Mode coverage of Spend/regen/post-cast-delay behavior (PlayerManaPlayModeTests.cs) continues to pass and is extended to cover the new reset entry point and denied-cast signal.\",\n      \"gate_id\": \"VAL-001\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"reference\": \"GDD §3 Player Experience Success Criteria\",\n      \"requirement\": \"Validate that failure is readable through low-mana feedback as one of the stated readable failure causes.\",\n      \"gate_id\": \"VAL-002\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"reference\": \"Section 3 - Player Experience Success Criteria\",\n      \"requirement\": \"Failure caused by low mana is readable to the player through the mana indicator, as part of the required 'failure is readable' success criterion.\",\n      \"gate_id\": \"VAL-003\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"downstream_integration_obligations\": [],\n  \"gdd_evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"reference\": \"GDD §2 Resources, Feedback, and Failure — Player Mana ownership\",\n      \"requirement\": \"The shared Player Mana system is the single owner of current mana and the post-cast regeneration-delay state; spells spend mana through its owner-controlled spend interface; Player Mana does not own spell-local cooldown/charge/cast/placement/active-field state.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"reference\": \"GDD §5 Runtime Implementation\",\n      \"requirement\": \"Player Mana owns current mana and post-cast regeneration-delay state and exposes an owner-controlled spend/reset interface to spells and restart orchestration.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"reference\": \"GDD §2 Loss / Floor-run restart ownership\",\n      \"requirement\": \"Player Mana and its regeneration-delay state are required reset participants for the Floor Run/Restart Orchestrator.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"basis\": \"direct_gdd\",\n  \"source_scope\": \"required\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"notes\": \"Force Wave's 25-mana cost and other spell-local spend amounts remain owned by the individual spells, not this item; this item only owns the shared pool, regen-delay, spend interface, reset, and denied-cast signal.\",\n  \"repository_state_at_bootstrap\": \"partial\",\n  \"repository_evidence_at_bootstrap\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerMana.cs\",\n      \"evidence_type\": \"code\",\n      \"observation\": \"Implements CurrentMana/MaxMana, Spend(amount) with silent-fail-on-insufficient behavior, Tick-driven post-cast-delay regeneration, and a ManaSpent event; no reset entry point and no denied-cast event exist.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scripts/PlayerManaUI.cs\",\n      \"evidence_type\": \"code\",\n      \"observation\": \"Continuously binds a fill Image to CurrentMana/MaxMana every Update, satisfying the GDD's continuous mana indicator requirement.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Scenes/DoorPrototype.unity\",\n      \"evidence_type\": \"scene\",\n      \"observation\": \"Both PlayerMana.cs (guid fd54c6f00e974856b70833ac4771b9ae) and PlayerManaUI.cs (guid 0a03ab321b0847f59d3f91214dabcf5c) are serialized and wired on the Player/Canvas GameObjects, confirming the continuous mana indicator is currently integrated, not just buildable.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/Tests/PlayerManaPlayModeTests.cs\",\n      \"evidence_type\": \"test\",\n      \"observation\": \"Real Play Mode tests cover Spend success/failure, post-cast-delay non-regeneration, regeneration after delay, and delay-reset on subsequent spend.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"provenance\": {\n    \"origin\": \"verified_reconciliation_bootstrap\",\n    \"source_schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n    \"reconciliation_run_id\": \"20260821T193541Z-998ee7b5\",\n    \"verification_run_id\": \"20260821T195959Z-43dba5de\",\n    \"bootstrap_status_observation\": \"open\",\n    \"migration_id\": \"task-contract-schema-v2-20260822-r2\"\n  }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
